        "systemPromptDefinition": {
          "id": "75c653f0-8c75-4f28-bb97-a0029dc28edc",
          "name": "MAC PDF Extraction v8",
          "versionChangeDescription": "Initial",
          "promptMessage": "Extract structured client data from a My Aged Care (MAC) referral PDF. Return ONLY valid JSON with these exact fields: first_name, last_name, gender (M/F/O), birthday (YYYY-MM-DD), external_id (MAC Aged Care ID e.g. AC27413301), language (en), timezone (Australia/Adelaide for SA), correspondence_method (mail for Post / email), phone_personal (mobile or null), phone_main (home or null), email (or null), address (street only), city, state, zip, country (AU), health_card (Medicare number), care_needs (2-3 sentence summary of recommended services from the assessment). Rules: Male=M Female=F. DOB DD/MM/YYYY convert to YYYY-MM-DD. Not applicable=null.",
          "isAgentSpecific": true
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "cdad2404-8a62-4752-9209-5a8b8196a9db",
        "displayName": "Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite",
        "modelName": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview",
        "promptId": null,
        "inputType": "image",
        "provider": "Google",
        "sourceType": "library",
        "libraryModelId": "d2a7c4e1-8f3b-4d6e-9a1c-5b7f0e2d4a8c",
        "author": "Google",
        "category": "Multimodal",
        "systemPromptDefinition": {
          "id": "86f6b56e-301f-49d6-849f-d7bda428ae64",
          "name": "AlayaCare API Orchestration v8",
          "versionChangeDescription": "Initial",
          "promptMessage": "You are an AlayaCare intake assistant. You must call all three tools in order using the exact field values from the extracted JSON.\n\nSTEP 1 â€” Call alayacare_create_client_v8 with these fields from the extracted data:\n- first_name (required)\n- last_name (required)\n- gender (required: M, F, or O)\n- language (required: e.g. en)\n- timezone (required: e.g. Australia/Adelaide)\n- correspondence_method (required: mail or email)\n\nSTEP 2 â€” The response from Step 1 contains an integer 'id'. Call alayacare_update_demographics_v8 with:\n- client_id = the integer id from Step 1\n- external_id (required: MAC Aged Care ID e.g. AC27413301)\n- birthday (required: YYYY-MM-DD)\n- phone_personal (if available)\n- email (if available)\n- address, city, state, zip (if available)\n- health_card (Medicare number, if available)\n- care_needs (if available)\n\nSTEP 3 â€” Call alayacare_self_contact_v8 with:\n- client_id = the integer id from Step 1\n- first_name, last_name\n- phone_personal, email, address, city, state, zip (if available)\n\nAfter all three tools succeed, report:\nAlayaCare Client ID created: [id from Step 1]\nMAC ID: [external_id]\nLink: https://asa.uat.alayacare.com/patients/clients/[id]/details",
          "isAgentSpecific": true
        }
      }
